`、K8s `exit_code=2`）仅能证实应用进程发生了非零退出码终止，且与 `/work` 端点的 HTTP 请求高度相关。然而，日志中未包含具体的 Python 异常堆栈、Traceback 或错误类型。此外，Tracing 显示的 `response_code: 200` 与进程的 `Exit Code 2` 之间的具体因果关系尚未厘清（即无法确认是响应后崩溃还是错误被未捕获）。由于配置中 `diagnosis_publishable: false` 且缺乏决定性堆栈事实，无法发布确切的根因结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 92.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 92.5s (Evidence 84.0s, RCA 8.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 126.548, "metrics": {"run_id": "b87c0319024c43ea", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 126.57230353355408, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description